    <strong style="color:#38bdf8">Asia-Pacific via Malacca</strong> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
    <strong style="color:#c084fc">Europe via Bab el-Mandeb / Suez</strong> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
    <strong style="color:#34d399">South Asia and Americas</strong>.
    Chokepoints in <strong style="color:#F0B429">gold</strong>.
  </p>
</div>

